{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國男星布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）2022年被診斷患上失語症退出影壇，翌年再被診斷患上額顳葉失智症，早前有知情者爆料指布斯現已退化如嬰兒，被布斯與美國女星前妻狄美摩亞（Demi Moore）的女兒Tallulah於社交網站批評。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:03:48.425457+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:50:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:13.430070+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:13.430070+00:00","content_hash":"0975970361cd70f4ae6b4437dac2ea44b09c8cba5e45dbb8f1ec431e353ce8c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}